            "title": "Sacrifice was a visionary strategy game, too great to be forgotten",
            "date": "2023-05-28 01:06:50",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/PC Gamer/5151600576597773809",
            "notes": "<img src=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/v3aBxb2Mx2FW7XhjZydCS6.jpg\"/><br><br>\n                <em>We&apos;re digging into the PC Gamer archives to publish pieces from years gone by. This article was originally published in PC Gamer issue 162, June 2006.</em>..\n                <a href=\"https://www.pcgamer.com/sacrifice-was-a-visionary-strategy-game-too-great-to-be-forgotten?utm_source=steam&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\">Read more.</a>"
